{{#> layout title=title page=page}}{{#*inline "content"}}
<section data-portfolio data-generation="{{health.generation}}.{{inventory.generation}}.{{installations.generation}}">
{{> components/page-header title=title subtitle="Observed inventory, retained usage and installation acknowledgments."}}
<nav aria-label="Resource analysis"><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="?kind=all">All resources</a> <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="?kind=skills">Skills</a> <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="?kind=plugins">Plugins</a> <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="?kind=marketplaces">Marketplaces</a> <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary" href="/admin/analysis/campaigns">Optimization campaigns</a></nav>
<form class="sp-analysis-filters" method="get"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="{{kind}}"><label>From (UTC day)<input type="date" name="start" value="{{start}}" required></label><label>Until (exclusive UTC day)<input type="date" name="end" value="{{end}}" required></label><label>Find a resource<input name="search" value="{{search}}" maxlength="200"></label><button class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary">Apply</button></form>
<p data-live-status role="status" aria-live="polite">{{#if pending_jobs}}Preparing the requested range…{{else}}Connecting to snapshot updates…{{/if}}</p>
<p data-freshness>Snapshot generation {{health.generation}}; facts {{health.fact_generation}}/{{health.facts_generation}}; generated {{generated_at}}. Pending facts {{health.pending_changes}}; producer changes {{health.pending_producer_changes}}. {{health.last_error}}</p>
<p data-inventory-health>Inventory generation {{inventory.generation}}; {{inventory.entries}} observed entries. {{inventory.last_error}}</p>
<p data-installation-health>Installation coverage generation {{installations.generation}}; observed {{installations.observed_at}}.</p>
<p data-unknown-usage>{{#if totals}}{{unknown_usage}} invocations have unknown resource attribution.{{else}}Usage attribution is not yet available.{{/if}}</p>
<div class="sp-table"><div class="sp-table__scroll"><table class="sp-table__el"><thead><tr><th>Resource / availability</th><th>Uses / distinct authenticated users</th><th>Version attributed</th><th>Installation coverage</th><th>Recorded request spend</th><th>p95 latency upper bound</th><th>Conversation assessments</th><th>History coverage</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{#each rows}}<tr><td>{{#if href}}<a href="{{href}}">{{entry.resource_key}}</a>{{else}}{{entry.resource_key}}{{/if}}<br><small>{{entry.origin}} · {{entry.availability}} · {{entry.diagnostic}}</small></td><td>{{#if snapshot}}{{snapshot.metrics.invocations}} / {{users}}{{else}}Usage unavailable{{/if}}</td><td>{{#if snapshot}}{{snapshot.metrics.verified_invocations}} / {{snapshot.metrics.invocations}}{{else}}Unknown{{/if}}</td><td>{{#if installation}}{{installation.current_acknowledged_devices}}/{{installation.eligible_devices}} eligible devices acknowledged; {{installation.current_verified_devices}} verified; {{installation.unverifiable_installations}} installations unverified{{else}}Coverage pending or resource unbound{{/if}}</td><td>{{#if snapshot}}{{snapshot.metrics.priced_requests}}/{{snapshot.metrics.requests}} priced; {{#if cost}}{{cost}}{{else}}cost unknown{{/if}}; {{snapshot.metrics.failed_requests}} failed{{else}}Unknown{{/if}}</td><td>{{#if p95}}≤ {{p95}} ms{{else}}Unknown{{/if}}; {{#if snapshot}}{{snapshot.metrics.latency_measured_requests}}/{{snapshot.metrics.requests}} measured{{/if}}</td><td>{{#if snapshot}}{{snapshot.metrics.assessed_conversations}}/{{snapshot.metrics.assessment_conversations}} scored; {{snapshot.metrics.failed_assessments}} failed{{else}}Unknown{{/if}}</td><td>{{#if snapshot}}{{snapshot.suppressed_days}} suppressed days{{else}}{{usage_status}}{{/if}}</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="8">No observed inventory entries match this page.</td></tr>{{/each}}
</tbody></table></div></div>
<a data-next class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="{{next_href}}" {{#unless next_href}}hidden{{/unless}}>Next inventory page</a>
<p>Unused, unavailable, withdrawn and conflicting entries remain visible. Historical membership before the first inventory observation is unknown. Unbound entries have no verified resource attribution; unknown usage is kept separate from installation coverage.</p>
<p>Eligible devices have a current consumer grant and active enrollment. A verified device has at least one acknowledged installation with successful readback for the current publication. Offline installation outboxes cannot be counted by the server until acknowledged. Legacy receipts do not establish a device or consumer identity.</p>
<p>Each request is counted once within a resource. Related spend overlaps across resources and must not be summed. Failed attempts retain recorded spend; unknown pricing remains unknown. Percentiles merge versioned latency buckets and show an upper bound with measured-request coverage. Distinct counts include only device-authenticated consumers; they do not count unknown identities as real users. Distinct users and sessions older than90 days are unavailable; unsafe historical cohorts are suppressed.</p>
</section>
{{/inline}}{{#*inline "scripts"}}<script type="module" src="/js/pages/analysis-portfolio.js?v={{css_version}}"></script>{{/inline}}{{/layout}}
